<h3>Welcome to the Middlesex County College Digital Library</h3>

<p>This digital library (MCCDL)&nbsp;for Middlesex County College houses&nbsp;both the scholarly and creative&nbsp;outout of faculty and students&nbsp;as well as the historical materials of the College held in the College Archives.</p>

<p><strong>SCHOLARLY &amp; CREATIVE WORK</strong></p>

<p>Students, faculty, and staff at create significant&nbsp;scholarly, research, and creative work. This collection is the central location to find and share that work. Student publications include QuoVadis and the Blue Colt Vibe. College publications include Middlesex Now and This Month @ Middlesex.</p>

<p><strong>HISTORICAL MATERIALS</strong></p>

<p>Historical materials encompass&nbsp;the College&#39;s Annual Reports,&nbsp;Board of Trustees meeting minutes, yearbooks, photographs, and other resources related to the history of the College.</p>

<p>If you have any questions about material that appears on this site, please do not hesitate to <a href="mailto:mochoa@middlesexcc.edu">contact us</a>.</p>

<p>This resource is administered by the College Library, and is powered by&nbsp;<a href="https://sobekdigital.com">Sobek Digital Hosting &amp; Consulting, LLC</a>.</p>

